# Base URL of the Vessel Caller API. Leave empty to use a same-origin "/api"
# (works with the Vite dev proxy and when the API is reverse-proxied in prod).
# For a separately-hosted backend set e.g. https://api.vesselcaller.example
VITE_API_BASE=

# Frontend monitoring is intentionally not configured at Vite build time.
# The immutable bundle reads same-origin /api/runtime-config at runtime so the
# identical artifact can be promoted through staging and production unchanged.

# Real-backend Playwright runs require E2E_PASSWORD to be supplied from the
# invoking shell or CI environment. Never store a reusable E2E password here.
